<item><title>UN to discuss Minurso mandate after Russian veto</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/eh/un-to-discuss-minurso-mandate-after-russian-veto-61311d/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/eh/un-to-discuss-minurso-mandate-after-russian-veto-61311d/</guid><category>Western Sahara</category><description>The UN General Assembly will debate the future of the UN mission in Western Sahara following Russia&apos;s Security Council veto.</description><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 22:08:43 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/eh/un-to-discuss-minurso-mandate-after-russian-veto-61311d/share.jpg" length="40190" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/eh/un-to-discuss-minurso-mandate-after-russian-veto-61311d/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
